  "content": "<p>這是一片手工打造的櫻花林與沼澤地交織的地形，橫跨數百個區塊，供您作為下一個生存模式的出生點使用！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_52cc16d4-a1eb-4157-ad88-44fa985342ed.png\"></p><p>這片曾經繁茂的櫻花林坐落於山脈之巔，但附近的冰蓋已將其轉變為綿延數百區塊的幽暗沼澤地。一群掠奪者甚至在附近建立了前哨站，以探索這片高地櫻花沼澤！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_65636594-2745-4f07-a95e-12d4168254d9.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3c970bcc-a907-465f-b8bf-1ad32e42fe9f.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eccd26a7-7e8c-48af-bdc4-2e5d0ae1c4cd.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_541c56c6-953d-41e8-bb09-eecf63cfbd4a.png\"></p><p>想在基岩版上遊玩這個世界嗎？請在此下載：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/maps/highland-cherry-swamp-for-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/maps/highland-cherry-swamp-for-bedrock</a></p>",
